---
description: Mandatory tenant isolation rules
alwaysApply: true
---
All tenant owned data requires client_id.
Every domain/repository operation on tenant data receives explicit TenantContext.
Never trust route IDs alone.
Never retrieve embeddings or knowledge across clients.
Hostname routing fails closed. Preview hosts must not serve another tenant.
Add cross tenant tests for every new tenant owned resource.
Fail closed when tenant context is missing.
